{
  "name": "tg-refrescar-catalogo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Refrescar cache del catálogo (onClick)\n\nReplica el TOGGLE manual: apaga y prende el workflow del bot por la API de n8n → el próximo mensaje re-consulta el catálogo (staticData se recarga).\n\n**Setup (una sola vez):**\n1. Settings → n8n API → crear API key.\n2. Crear credencial **Header Auth**: Name = `X-N8N-API-KEY`, Value = la key. Asignarla a los dos nodos HTTP.\n3. En `Config`, pegar el ID del workflow del bot (está en la URL del editor: /workflow/**ID**).\n\n**Notas:** el bot queda ~1-2 s sin webhook (igual que el toggle a mano). `Prender Bot` reintenta 3 veces; si aún así falla, prendelo desde la UI. El cache igual se auto-renueva solo a los 10 min — esto es para el \"ya\" después de aplicar SQL.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky-leeme",
      "name": "LEEME",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-100, -380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-click",
      "name": "Al hacer clic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-base",
              "name": "baseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:5678",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-wf",
              "name": "workflowId",
              "value": "PONER-ID-DEL-WORKFLOW-DEL-BOT",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [200, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.baseUrl }}/api/v1/workflows/{{ $('Config').first().json.workflowId }}/deactivate",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-apagar",
      "name": "Apagar Bot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [400, 0],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.baseUrl }}/api/v1/workflows/{{ $('Config').first().json.workflowId }}/activate",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-prender",
      "name": "Prender Bot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [600, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Al hacer clic": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Apagar Bot", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Apagar Bot": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Prender Bot", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
